## Third-party data and content (NOT covered by the licence above)

| Item | Owner / terms |
|---|---|
| `backend/data/secondary/crop_recommendation.csv` | Kaggle *Crop Recommendation Dataset* by **atharvaingle**. Used here for non-commercial academic work with attribution; re-fetch any time with `python scripts/download_secondary_dataset.py --download`. The dataset's own terms govern it. |
| Crop agronomy ranges in `backend/app/ml/knowledge.py` | Compiled from **TNAU Agritech Portal / Crop Production Guide**, ICAR package-of-practices and **KVK Dakshina Kannada** publications. Figures are quoted with their sources in the app and in the report; copyright remains with the originating institutions. |
| District statistics (rainfall, soil types, crop areas) | **KVK Dakshina Kannada** district profile and annual report; **KSNDMC/NRDMS** Dakshina Kannada natural-resource report. |
| Reviewed papers listed on the Project Comparison page | Their respective publishers. Accuracy figures are quoted, attributed and marked as the authors' own claims; nothing from a paywalled source is reproduced beyond a short factual figure. |

## Fonts and assets

No external fonts, icon packs or CDN libraries are used: the UI draws its own SVG icons and charts
and uses system font stacks. The screenshots in `docs/screenshots/` are generated from this
project's own UI on seeded demo data and may be reused in the project report.
